{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荷里活女星珍妮花露柏絲（Jennifer Lopez）前晚出席演唱會電影《THE JLO SHOW: Live in Las Vegas》於美國洛杉磯舉行的首映禮，她以白色透視長裙配白色花花圖案外袍上陣大騷性感。</p><p>珍妮花更嫌透視裝唔夠性感，紅地氈期間她突然拉開外袍，大騷其超強巨胸，令人看得血脈沸騰！不過其服裝打扮不及身上的鑽石頸鏈搶眼，據知她的鑽石頸鏈價值連城，但是頸鏈中間位置的巨型黃鑽石已足足100卡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:03:49.139959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T15:17:14.975629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:57:14.816200+00:00","content_hash":"119280d9a2011e3b8326a8b804e1beeac74d310de202b7b5a64430babd4e2ca8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:03:49.139959+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}